<title>USA: CFM Technologies Q1 Jan 31 net increases.</title>
<headline>CFM Technologies Q1 Jan 31 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, Pa. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							    January 31,</p>
<p>							1997	     1996</p>
<p> Net sales				   $  14,792	 $  9,611</p>
<p> Net income					1,374		726</p>
<p> Net income per share			   0.21	     0.18</p>
<p> Weighted average common and common	6,416	    3,994</p>
<p>			(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  CFM Technologies Inc said that subsequent to the end of the first fiscal quarter, it completed a public offering of 1,750,500 Common Shares.</p>
